WEBVTT

00:22.850 --> 00:24.880
Storage complete.

00:25.550 --> 00:27.620
Switching over to submersible mode now.

00:27.620 --> 00:30.530
Roger. Flood forward ballast tanks.

00:30.530 --> 00:32.620
Flooding forward ballast tanks.

00:55.480 --> 00:56.620
This is the Ishin.

00:56.620 --> 00:58.710
We are now resuming underwater navigation.

01:02.590 --> 01:04.420
Dive angle 5 degrees!

01:04.730 --> 01:06.130
Begin dive!

01:33.050 --> 01:46.420
Sora ni toketa hane o matoi tobitate tsubasa de

01:33.050 --> 01:39.660
Cloaked in feathers melted into the sky

01:39.660 --> 01:46.430
Take flight on wings

02:00.770 --> 02:03.940
Morokute nigai kajitsu no you ni

02:00.780 --> 02:03.950
Like fragile but bitter fruit

02:03.940 --> 02:07.150
Hito no kokoro o miryou suru no

02:03.950 --> 02:07.160
It fascinates people's hearts

02:07.150 --> 02:10.250
Togi sumasareta shiroi yubi de

02:07.160 --> 02:08.660
The shadow that manipulates

02:08.660 --> 02:10.260
With sharpened fingers gleaming white

02:10.250 --> 02:13.420
Ayatsuru kage wa chi no kaori

02:10.260 --> 02:13.430
Smells of blood

02:13.420 --> 02:26.420
Shizumi aseta kodou o yobi samasu shi no sasayaki

02:13.430 --> 02:19.870
The whisper of Death

02:19.870 --> 02:26.430
That awakens fading heartbeats

02:27.400 --> 02:33.770
Sora ni toketa hane o matoi

02:27.410 --> 02:33.780
Cloaked in feathers melted into the sky

02:33.770 --> 02:40.010
Tobitatsu no wa gin no tsubasa

02:33.780 --> 02:40.020
Silver wings take flight

02:40.010 --> 02:46.490
Fukai kaze ni tsume o tatete

02:40.020 --> 02:46.490
Become the power that tears at deep winds

02:46.490 --> 02:56.220
Kirisaku chikara to nare

02:46.490 --> 02:56.230
With poised claws

02:57.210 --> 03:00.400
Brought to you by
BiG-GuY Fansubbing

03:01.480 --> 03:03.640
Respond, Ishin! Respond!

03:06.210 --> 03:09.790
Episode 4
Invasion

03:12.390 --> 03:13.550
It sounds like the hull is being crushed!

03:15.360 --> 03:17.030
You sure about that?

03:17.030 --> 03:20.720
Yes, it's definitely the sound of a
structure being crushed!

03:21.500 --> 03:23.090
It can't be!

03:30.040 --> 03:32.730
The call sign from the Ishin has been cut off.

03:37.410 --> 03:39.470
The Ishin is lost.

03:44.920 --> 03:49.120
As of 0000 hours today, the search
for the Ishin will be called off.

03:50.260 --> 03:52.350
T-then...

03:52.990 --> 03:55.130
Observer, Phantom Vice-Commander,

03:55.130 --> 03:56.900
Lieutenant Colonel Shiba, killed in action.

03:56.900 --> 03:58.800
He will be promoted two ranks.

03:59.300 --> 04:00.490
That is all.

04:02.240 --> 04:07.270
Dying in an accident during a test run
must certainly be disappointing.

04:08.580 --> 04:11.640
Especially for a flashy guy like that.

04:19.890 --> 04:22.910
So you were alive, Toraji...

04:39.010 --> 04:40.770
Awesome! Awesome!

04:42.980 --> 04:45.240
I've never seen anything like this!

04:46.750 --> 04:47.820
Don't touch it.

04:47.820 --> 04:49.080
You cheapskate!

04:51.420 --> 04:53.250
Ouch!

04:53.250 --> 04:55.620
What was that for, you crybaby?!

04:57.560 --> 04:58.890
Crybaby?

04:58.890 --> 05:00.060
You got that right!

05:00.060 --> 05:03.590
When you opened that up, I saw you crying!

05:04.730 --> 05:06.400
Oh, that...

05:06.400 --> 05:09.270
I always get like that when I put this on.

05:12.610 --> 05:15.740
"Oh, that..." Playing dumb, huh?

05:16.940 --> 05:18.070
I'm sorry!

05:23.650 --> 05:24.620
Hey!

05:28.790 --> 05:30.160
You serious?

06:21.710 --> 06:22.640
Where are those two?

06:27.550 --> 06:29.220
We're almost at our destination.

06:29.220 --> 06:31.450
Circle this area for a while.

06:31.450 --> 06:32.780
Roger.

06:34.020 --> 06:37.460
So can we limit our search area to the pirate ship?

06:37.530 --> 06:40.960
If the report from the
Sixth Armored Platoon is correct,

06:40.960 --> 06:42.760
then the target should be in there.

06:42.900 --> 06:43.960
Roger.

06:44.470 --> 06:48.240
Are you the only current member
who knows of Shiba?

06:48.240 --> 06:50.370
Shiba?

06:50.370 --> 06:53.140
You mean the former vice-commander?

06:53.140 --> 06:55.910
I am. But what about him?

06:55.910 --> 06:57.540
It's nothing.

06:57.850 --> 07:00.610
If only that accident hadn't happened...

07:02.280 --> 07:03.650
Look at this!

07:05.320 --> 07:06.910
The heat level is different!

07:07.890 --> 07:09.820
Is it thermal wastewater from a ship?

07:10.990 --> 07:13.430
It coincides with a Theta-class submersible?

07:13.430 --> 07:14.950
Theta-class?

07:15.030 --> 07:16.550
If that's the case, then there aren't that many!

07:17.870 --> 07:19.330
It's the Ishin.

07:27.310 --> 07:28.370
Joe.

07:29.280 --> 07:31.110
Sana... Sana's still...

07:31.110 --> 07:31.950
Where is she?

07:31.950 --> 07:33.000
I don't know.

07:33.280 --> 07:36.220
Let's get up to the deck first and
gain control of their main gun.

07:54.900 --> 07:57.630
This has been too easy. Could it be...

07:57.810 --> 07:59.070
Cover me.

08:03.780 --> 08:05.180
Where are you off to?

08:05.180 --> 08:06.510
And in such a hurry, too!

08:13.350 --> 08:15.220
Put the gun down.

08:22.530 --> 08:25.100
"Like a moth to fire" or however they say it.

08:25.100 --> 08:26.620
I've been waiting for you.

08:26.800 --> 08:29.300
Where's Sana? Where did you take Sana?

08:29.300 --> 08:33.210
You really need to calm down a bit.
What are you, a dog in heat?!

08:33.210 --> 08:35.200
Let Sana go!

08:36.210 --> 08:40.010
Like I'm gonna say, "yeah, sure"
and hand her over?

08:44.590 --> 08:45.680
Hm?

08:50.020 --> 08:54.090
So you've got someone else
to do the dirty work for you?

08:54.530 --> 08:56.520
Don't be rude.

09:05.470 --> 09:09.280
It seems Venus is being held captive
on a ship belonging to the pirates.

09:09.280 --> 09:11.040
We're on our way to retrieve her.

09:11.610 --> 09:13.950
Report the model of the vessel.

09:13.950 --> 09:17.390
It has yet to be identified. However...

09:17.390 --> 09:18.780
What is it?

09:19.320 --> 09:21.860
From the heat value detected
from the discharged water,

09:21.860 --> 09:24.060
we estimate that it's in the same class as the Ishin.

09:24.060 --> 09:25.860
Estimate?

09:26.690 --> 09:29.560
Roger. Execute the mission immediately.

09:31.200 --> 09:32.330
That Shiba...

09:32.330 --> 09:34.460
So he WAS alive after all.

09:40.640 --> 09:43.080
What is he after?

09:43.080 --> 09:45.980
Is he planning to team up with Satsuma?

09:46.780 --> 09:48.150
Prepare for mission.

09:48.150 --> 09:54.290
Venus' current location is point RG140C,
in the pirate submarine.

09:54.290 --> 09:56.280
From this point on, this ship will be
referred to as the Ishin.

10:04.970 --> 10:06.300
Move out!

10:21.720 --> 10:24.510
So you're ex-Phantom too, eh?

10:26.590 --> 10:28.680
Man, what an unfriendly guy.

10:28.960 --> 10:31.980
Fine then. Come at me from wherever you want.

10:34.330 --> 10:35.760
What's wrong, little boy?

10:35.760 --> 10:38.430
Hurry up! Sometime today, okay?

10:43.670 --> 10:44.900
Joe...

10:57.720 --> 10:59.790
Even if I take away the fact that
you're wearing that suit,

10:59.790 --> 11:02.190
you've still got some nice moves, little boy.

11:02.360 --> 11:05.330
But you'd better do something
or your arm is going to break.

11:12.530 --> 11:17.060
You're pretty good, for me to
have to draw my sword.

11:24.250 --> 11:25.750
Don't aim for the hull.

11:25.750 --> 11:26.870
We'll smoke them out!

11:27.850 --> 11:29.340
That's boring!

11:34.890 --> 11:37.120
So, they're here for the girl, huh?

11:37.560 --> 11:38.390
Hold it!

11:39.290 --> 11:40.700
He got away.

11:40.700 --> 11:41.990
Don't worry about him!

11:42.260 --> 11:43.930
We're the ones who need to get away.

11:43.930 --> 11:45.130
Battle stations!

11:45.130 --> 11:46.060
Okay!

11:46.700 --> 11:49.570
Your armor is in the lowest hold.

11:51.310 --> 11:55.330
It just so happens that I've got
some history with Phantom too.

11:55.810 --> 11:59.470
I'm well aware that they're not an easy
opponent to handle.

12:01.150 --> 12:03.020
Protect that girl!

12:03.020 --> 12:06.040
Don't let Phantom get a hold of her!

12:11.560 --> 12:13.360
Those jerks.

12:13.360 --> 12:16.560
Everyone's left me behind.

12:17.100 --> 12:20.530
I'd better get paid for my troubles at least.

12:24.910 --> 12:27.240
Wh-what the?

12:39.290 --> 12:40.820
Come on, guys!

12:40.820 --> 12:43.450
Give 'em a loud blast!

12:52.470 --> 12:53.560
Here they come!

12:53.770 --> 12:54.700
Let's go.

13:01.610 --> 13:03.440
They're just screwing around with us!

13:03.680 --> 13:05.150
You'd better prepare yourselves!

13:05.150 --> 13:09.550
Capturing Venus is still our main priority.
Attack with discretion.

13:13.220 --> 13:16.780
Four Phantom Gladiators
approaching from direction 203!

13:17.530 --> 13:20.120
The missiles have all been shot down!

13:20.530 --> 13:22.530
Oryo! Launch the ship.

13:22.530 --> 13:24.930
Roger! Ishin, launch!

13:25.130 --> 13:26.570
Ahead slow.

13:32.870 --> 13:34.240
Hold on there!

13:34.640 --> 13:36.510
Where do you think you're going?

13:36.510 --> 13:38.210
Jin! I'm going to where Jin is!

13:38.210 --> 13:39.910
Stop whining!

13:45.790 --> 13:47.660
Calm down, okay?

13:47.660 --> 13:51.990
If you make a fuss, it'll be hard for
everyone to stay calm and fight.

13:58.900 --> 13:59.730
Split up!

14:12.050 --> 14:13.600
We're going aboard, Kyoushiro.

14:17.420 --> 14:18.580
Qing Lang!

14:23.160 --> 14:25.060
You idiot! Where the hell are you aiming?!

14:34.540 --> 14:35.270
Jin...

14:35.270 --> 14:36.500
No...

14:36.500 --> 14:38.440
You're Joe, aren't you?!

14:56.290 --> 14:59.330
Riki, take care of things here. I'll look for Venus.

14:59.330 --> 15:00.620
Roger.

15:03.100 --> 15:04.890
Up there! Fire! Fire!

15:05.500 --> 15:08.020
Out of my way!

15:09.540 --> 15:11.730
Wh-what the?

15:18.480 --> 15:20.380
So it's you, Jin.

15:31.030 --> 15:32.930
We've got no choice. Kyoushiro, to the ship!

15:44.940 --> 15:46.540
Kyoushiro...

15:46.540 --> 15:47.730
You bastard!

16:41.060 --> 16:42.400
Vice-Commander...

16:42.400 --> 16:44.400
So you ARE alive after all...

16:44.400 --> 16:47.420
Long time no see, Steve.

16:47.900 --> 16:51.270
Are you telling me that the sinking of
the Ishin was all a sham?

16:51.840 --> 16:53.440
It's exactly the way you see it.

16:53.440 --> 16:56.570
I'm not handing over that girl.
Get the hell outta here.

17:02.580 --> 17:03.550
Riki!

17:03.950 --> 17:04.850
What?

17:10.160 --> 17:12.520
Joe! Jin! You bastards!

17:13.930 --> 17:15.950
Why did you betray us?

17:16.530 --> 17:19.060
I'm sure you wouldn't understand.

17:43.890 --> 17:46.020
You're looking good, Oryo!

18:11.820 --> 18:16.520
One Gladiator confirmed in the sea
around the caves. It's unit 4.

18:19.090 --> 18:20.690
Damn you, Joe!

18:25.770 --> 18:27.670
Can you hear me, you two?

18:28.370 --> 18:31.640
We've reached just about
the right depth to go under.

18:31.640 --> 18:32.810
You got enough air?

18:32.810 --> 18:33.770
What?

18:33.770 --> 18:36.480
You'd better hold on tight
so you don't get swept away.

18:36.480 --> 18:39.880
If you get sucked into the caterpillar, you won't be
able to survive even if you are a Gladiator.

18:40.510 --> 18:42.880
They're in Submarine Mode!

18:42.950 --> 18:44.320
Damn. Retreat!

18:44.320 --> 18:46.920
Retreat? What about Venus?

18:46.920 --> 18:48.220
They got in my way.

18:48.220 --> 18:49.590
Got in your way?

18:49.590 --> 18:51.760
You should be ashamed to say that!

18:51.760 --> 18:53.520
They're just stinking pirates!

18:56.360 --> 18:57.660
Joe, you bastard!

18:57.660 --> 19:00.330
If we stay here any longer,
we'll get sucked into the whirlpool!

19:00.330 --> 19:02.030
Let's get outta here!

19:10.080 --> 19:11.450
This is Romeo 1.

19:11.450 --> 19:14.940
Retrieve Kyoushiro and rendezvous at Point 530.

19:15.020 --> 19:16.040
Roger.

19:46.180 --> 19:47.010
Jin!

19:47.480 --> 19:48.450
Sana!

19:49.750 --> 19:50.980
Everything's okay now.

19:50.980 --> 19:52.280
Thank goodness!

20:05.470 --> 20:07.520
I guess I should thank you.

20:08.940 --> 20:10.300
But what about Sana?

20:10.300 --> 20:13.340
Thanks to you guys, all my secrets are out now.

20:13.340 --> 20:14.910
You'd better take responsibility for that.

20:14.910 --> 20:15.880
Eh?

20:17.180 --> 20:20.440
I'm going to leave Sana in your care.

20:20.750 --> 20:23.550
But on one condition.

20:23.820 --> 20:25.180
Condition?

20:25.920 --> 20:29.120
A man by the name of Shuzo Chikura
lives in Nanso.

20:31.020 --> 20:32.560
Chikura?

20:32.560 --> 20:34.700
Go to that man.

20:34.700 --> 20:38.530
That man will protect Sana for sure.

20:38.530 --> 20:40.020
You got that?

20:50.980 --> 20:52.450
Let's go, Sana.

20:54.410 --> 20:55.350
Okay!

21:09.400 --> 21:12.090
Are you sure you can trust that man?

21:12.430 --> 21:15.170
It's not that I trusted him.

21:15.170 --> 21:17.070
Then what is it?

21:20.470 --> 21:22.310
Yosaku! Prepare to dive!

21:22.310 --> 21:23.240
Aye, sah!

21:26.710 --> 21:28.200
He said Chikura?

21:28.550 --> 21:32.420
Yeah, I was planning on meeting him from the start.

21:32.790 --> 21:36.920
I didn't think that guy, Shiba, would know so much.

21:36.920 --> 21:38.620
Who is that man?

21:40.260 --> 21:42.160
You'll find out when we get there.

21:44.530 --> 21:45.730
Where's Gora?

21:48.940 --> 21:52.340
You jerks! Don't you ignore me!

21:52.340 --> 21:54.930
There's no way you're leaving me behind!

22:25.240 --> 22:29.750
Nagai kioku no hate ni

22:25.240 --> 22:29.710
If at the end of our long memory

22:29.710 --> 22:35.550
Time will tear us apart

22:29.750 --> 22:35.580
Toki ga bokura o wakatsu nara

22:37.590 --> 22:44.230
If at the end of my sweet memory with you

22:37.620 --> 22:44.260
Kimi to amai kioku no hate ni

22:44.230 --> 22:50.530
You and I become one again

22:44.260 --> 22:50.570
Mata bokura hitotsu nara

22:50.530 --> 22:57.710
From a quietly stretched arm's length away

22:50.570 --> 22:57.740
Sotto te nobashita kyori kara

22:57.710 --> 23:02.410
I will search for the meaning

22:57.740 --> 23:02.450
lmi o sagasu kara

23:02.410 --> 23:08.250
Can you hear it? The words dance in midair

23:02.450 --> 23:08.290
Kikoeru? Kotoba ga chuu ni mau

23:08.250 --> 23:14.060
We shall meet when our wish is granted

23:08.290 --> 23:14.090
Kanaeta toki ni deau

23:14.060 --> 23:17.730
Leaving only their reverse behind

23:14.090 --> 23:17.760
Reverse dake nokoshite

23:17.730 --> 23:21.130
The torn words

23:17.760 --> 23:21.160
Chigireta kotoba

23:21.130 --> 23:27.260
Blurred time and light

23:21.160 --> 23:27.300
Kasureta jikan to hikari

23:29.440 --> 23:33.770
I have found them now

23:29.470 --> 23:33.810
lma, mitsuketa kara

23:35.230 --> 23:46.830
<b><i>Next Episode</i></b>

23:44.220 --> 23:47.640
Next time on Innocent Venus:

23:47.820 --> 23:50.740
<b><i>Episode</i> <i>5
<b><i>Duet</i></b></i></b>

23:48.260 --> 23:49.490
"Duet"
